  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAMEROON BASIC EDUCATION SUPPORT PROJECT (CAMBESP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to contribute to the implementation of the Government of Cameroon Education and Training Sector Strategy for the period 2020-2030 currently being finalized through with a focus on the following:
&#x2022; Improving access to and completion of pre-primary and primary education.
&#x2022; Improving the quality of education in the pre-primary, primary and primary cycles.
&#x2022; Enhancing scientific and digital literacy among primary school teachers and students. 
&#x2022; Providing access to nutrition and balanced school nutrition for vulnerable children or children living in disadvantaged areas, while strengthening their health, good growth, and psychosocial development.
&#x2022; Transforming the curricula to train a new type of qualified teachers, able to use alternative teaching approaches, taking into       account the needs of the national economy and the job market, while promoting the entrepreneurial culture among young people.</narrative>
  </description>
